add(6,'unproved claim',[148],['111–129'],'\\boxed{\\gamma\\chi=2}','For π_i²=χπ_i, the ansatz σ_i=I−γπ_i has σ_i²=I whenever γχ=2. Expansion of I+σ_1⊗σ_2 has coefficients (2,−γ,−γ,γ²).','The operator relation is reconstructed from the χ-splitting setting; γχ=2 is a sufficient condition for this ansatz, not existence of such γ for arbitrary χ.','The boxed scalar condition and coefficient specialization are explicit. They cannot be dropped in an all-χ reading.')
