add(8,'unproved claim',[148],['149–165'],'\\mathcal H_i=\\text{\\unsure{noyau} de}','The intended sheaf H appears to consist of endomorphisms of an extension acting by scalars on its endpoints, with kernel Hom(M,L) and quotient scalar-end data modulo simultaneous scalars.','The kernel map is missing. For a locally split extension, the sheaf sequence 0→Hom(M,L)→H/O·id→O²/O·(1,1)→0 is a valid reconstruction; its global-section surjectivity is not automatic.','The displayed sequence is present, but the unfinished definition prevents treating exactness in an unspecified category as proved.')
