# Third reading: all24 odd leaves147–193, with notes80–197.
# Each tuple is an individually read source adjudication, not a cue-based classification.
def narr(n,scan,line,words,statement,reason,kind='other',verdict='kept',merge=None):
    add(n,kind,[scan],[line],words,'Nonmathematical reused typescript: '+statement,'No mathematical reconstruction. Attribution to the author is retained; psychological, cultural, biographical and medical assertions are not independently endorsed.',reason,verdict=verdict,merge=merge)
narr(80,147,'63–79','Le côté exceptionnel se trouverait plutôt','He distinguishes ordinary repression from what he regards as exceptional intensity of investment in work.','The contrast is explicit; the conditional se trouverait should remain visible.')
narr(81,147,'67–72','sa haine ... de ce qui faisait d’elle une femme','He attributes devastation in his mother’s life to an alleged hidden hatred of womanhood, contrasting his own retained tenderness.','The note correctly treats another person’s inner life as his retrospective interpretation.')
narr(82,147,'75–79','aimdirectedness','He classifies task-directedness as yang, tension and closure to unrelated experience.','The English term and classification are present; no psychological law is demonstrated.')
narr(83,147,'82–87','super-man ou super-mâle','He hypothesizes that disproportionate energy evokes admiration and unconscious defensive antagonism.','The note preserves the attribution of motives rather than adopting them as fact.')
narr(84,147,'88–95','super-père','He relates ambivalent attraction and repulsion to paternal conflict, adding that yin traits sustain sympathy.','This is a distinct explanatory addition to the superman hypothesis, explicitly expressed on the leaf.')
narr(85,147,'98–103','relancer sans cesse l’estime de mes pairs','He asks whether one motive for accumulating works was to force and renew peers’ esteem; the next leaf expressly acknowledges the desire.','The question continues on149 and its answer is read there; it is not an open mathematical problem.')
narr(86,149,'188–194','Oui, il y a bien eu en moi ce secret désir','He acknowledges desiring an enlarged public image, returned as praise and hostility.','This answers the question begun on147 and is merged with that same self-examination.',merge=85)
